/Title (CP3AI is an automated Cup Pong system that combines computer vision, embedded systems, and robotics to track and manage a game in real time. The system will detect successful shots, automatically update the game state, and use a motorized mechanical system to remove and rearrange cups for repositioning. LEDs will provide visual feedback, while a web or mobile interface will allow players to view game information and control the system.)
